<title>CHINA: China stock exchanges to close on May 1 and May 2.</title>
<headline>China stock exchanges to close on May 1 and May 2.</headline>
<dateline>SHANGHAI 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Shanghai and Shenzhen stock exchanges will be closed on May 1 and May 2 for the official Labour Day holiday, the Shanghai Securities News reported on Friday.</p>
<p>Trading will resume on Monday, May 5, the newspaper said.</p>
